6. 全量批次：`bash experiments/batch_production/run_groups_sequential.sh`（默认跑完优先 3 个 group 后接剩余全部；加 `--batch1-only` 只跑前 3 个）
7. 监控：`bash experiments/batch_production/watch_progress.sh <group>`

